    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST &amp; FOLLOW TO GET NOTIFIED WHEN LAUNCHED!!!</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/d6894e7abac7b8b9e3b2a77503410767.poster.avif?t=1754475928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/d6894e7abac7b8b9e3b2a77503410767.webm?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/d6894e7abac7b8b9e3b2a77503410767.mp4?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/c6418dbc1582d391966e06bb11276108.avif?t=1754475928\" /></div><br><br><strong>Bangkok Story: A Stray Dog</strong> is a top-down 2D story-driven adventure game inspired by true events in Bangkok, Thailand 2017. The game lets you experience the harsh life of a homeless man who tries to cope with his mental struggle of the cruelty of the world. The story is framed by an interview he gives to a famous blogger, about how a chance encounter with a stray dog made him regain his sense of self once more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.poster.avif?t=1754475928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.webm?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.mp4?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>What could make a man homeless? Is it one's family's financial situation? Is it the government? Is it because of our friends? Or... is it because of oneself?<br><br>Explore a journey from his childhood to the present. Unravel what made a man lose everything.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.poster.avif?t=1754475928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.webm?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience the struggle of a homeless man's and a stray dog's life.<br></li><li> Traverse the life of a homeless man through his past in Thailand's rural areas.<br></li><li> Show different ways to show affections for the dog.<br></li><li> The game tells thought-provoking ways of how to live a proper life.<br></li><li> If you are sensitive about animals, friends, or family, I can't guarantee that you won't cry.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/c6418dbc1582d391966e06bb11276108.avif?t=1754475928\" /></div><br><br><strong>Bangkok Story: A Stray Dog</strong> is a top-down 2D story-driven adventure game inspired by true events in Bangkok, Thailand 2017. The game lets you experience the harsh life of a homeless man who tries to cope with his mental struggle of the cruelty of the world. The story is framed by an interview he gives to a famous blogger, about how a chance encounter with a stray dog made him regain his sense of self once more.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.poster.avif?t=1754475928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.webm?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/98786e525f1b3096ed204e063bfe2a25.mp4?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>What could make a man homeless? Is it one's family's financial situation? Is it the government? Is it because of our friends? Or... is it because of oneself?<br><br>Explore a journey from his childhood to the present. Unravel what made a man lose everything.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.poster.avif?t=1754475928\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2121450/extras/4044394d696c048f7d183cdbfee0ce3e.webm?t=1754475928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience the struggle of a homeless man's and a stray dog's life.<br></li><li> Traverse the life of a homeless man through his past in Thailand's rural areas.<br></li><li> Show different ways to show affections for the dog.<br></li><li> The game tells thought-provoking ways of how to live a proper life.<br></li><li> If you are sensitive about animals, friends, or family, I can't guarantee that you won't cry.</li></ul>",
